    <string name="dreams_engine_file_caveat">Not every engine can read an existing recording; some only listen to the live microphone. If the transcript sounds like the room rather than your dream, that is why — switch back to the system engine.</string>
    <string name="dreams_engine_none">No app on this phone offers a transcription engine other apps can call. That is the only hook Android provides: a transcription app that does not publish one cannot be reached from here.</string>
